---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="关于 · il7510n" path="/about/">
  <section class="wrap about">
    <h1 data-reveal style="--i:0">关于</h1>
    <p class="intro" data-reveal style="--i:1">
      工程师，偶尔写字。对交互手感、图形学和「把东西做久」有兴趣。
      这个博客既是写字的地方，也是前端动效的练习场——你看到的所有效果都是手写的，没有用现成模板。
    </p>

    <div class="sec"><span class="label">时间线</span></div>
    <div class="timeline">
      <svg class="tl" viewBox="0 0 2 1000" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M 1 0 L 1 1000" pathLength="1" style="stroke-dasharray: 1; stroke-dashoffset: 1;"></path>
      </svg>
      <!-- TODO: 以下条目替换成你自己的经历 -->
      <div class="tl-item" data-io>
        <span class="y">2026</span>
        <h3>这个博客上线</h3>
        <p>Astro + 手写动效：横滑展区、曲线描绘、心电图进度条。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-item" data-io>
        <span class="y">2025</span>
        <h3>NexusCompanion</h3>
        <p>从零搭了一个多租户 AI 助手：webchat、存储切换、可观测性。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-item" data-io>
        <span class="y">2024</span>
        <h3>开始折腾 GLSL</h3>
        <p>Shadertoy 上手，喜欢上了波形、黑洞和一切会动的东西。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .about { padding-top: 16vh; padding-bottom: 8rem; }
  .about h1 { font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 6vw, 4rem); margin: 0; }
  .intro { color: var(--fg-2); max-width: 36rem; }
</style>

<script>
  const tl = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.timeline');
  const line = tl?.querySelector<SVGPathElement>('path');

  if (tl && line) {
    (window as any).__fx = (window as any).__fx || [];
    (window as any).__fx.push(() => {
      const r = tl.getBoundingClientRect();
      const p = Math.min(1, Math.max(0, (innerHeight * 0.75 - r.top) / r.height));
      line.style.strokeDashoffset = String(1 - p);
    });
  }
</script>
